Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.40,0:00:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.22,0:01:16.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.90,0:02:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we finally came up for air, we\Nthought we had made it to safety,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but as bad luck would have it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.14,0:02:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Seadramon had followed\Nus, and he had other ideas.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.60,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,340,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}A Dangerous Game! Pinocchimon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:19.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.79,0:02:23.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Mountain's ocean is\Nalmost completely gone! But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:28.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digital Ocean is being reconfigured\Nbecause we kicked its Dark Masters butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite interesting, but\Ndoes this affect us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely, it changes everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:34.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we're gonna get any\Nsurfing in, we better hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.50,0:02:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those wimpy Dark Masters\Nare no threat to Super Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:40.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the Digi-toot I like\Nto hear from you humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's go! Yeah! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.38,0:02:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not through here yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.92,0:02:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed,\Nsome of our friends are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.70,0:02:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.84,0:02:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one is to remember Wizardmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.04,0:02:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one next to it is for Piximon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.64,0:02:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That one's Chuumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.30,0:03:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this one here is for Whamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.30,0:03:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, they're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.84,0:03:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's more like they've been\Ndownloaded to a different computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:08.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.79,0:03:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're digital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.98,0:03:12.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our information just gets reconfigured.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.18,0:03:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What better reason do we\Nneed to get the Dark Masters?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Payback for making our friends leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.66,0:03:20.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.57,0:03:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every time we fight, we wind\Nup losing another friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.64,0:03:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is warm, Mimi, and sometimes people\Nwe like get hurt, so deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.10,0:03:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Tai. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you stop and think about\Nother people's feelings for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.62,0:03:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.53,0:03:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know you're right, Tai,\Nbut just give us a little space.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We miss our friends who\Nfought alongside of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not everyone has ice running\Nthrough their veins like you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.20,0:03:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.11,0:03:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so busy looking forward that\Nyou never take time to look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:55.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've lost some good friends here, Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it's nice to remember\Nthem once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.78,0:04:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we always stop to do that, we'll\Nnever have enough time to save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.42,0:04:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you hear me, but\Nyou're not listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're making everyone upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You two are supposed to be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.86,0:04:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Mimi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.54,0:04:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are sitting ducks out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.16,0:04:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find some place a\Nlittle less out in the open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm not as cold as matt thinks am i\Nmaybe i was a little too rough on Tai
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.52,0:04:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's gotta respect our feelings\Ni've never seen matt so upset before
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.56,0:04:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this is terrible we should be\Nconcentrating on fighting our enemies not
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.14,0:04:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,each other i just know they're all\Nthinking about me that's why no one's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.10,0:04:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's so tired and cranky.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.58,0:04:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you stop, Kari?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.30,0:04:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear a noise just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.46,0:04:57.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you didn't hear\Nsomeone speaking a second ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean a voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't hear anything at all. Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.02,0:05:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's get back to the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.04,0:05:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's safety in numbers. Where were
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.60,0:05:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you two i thought i heard something
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.96,0:05:16.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it was just my imagination it's\Ndangerous out here so stay with
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:21.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the group okay i'm sorry if these kids\Ntake any longer to get here i will
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Develop have patience. Rome wasn't\Nbuilt in a day. Yeah, but I was, and I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.00,0:05:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tired of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.64,0:05:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are the trees
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.86,0:05:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,running so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.84,0:05:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things aren't moving faster. We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.14,0:05:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground we're standing\Non is accelerating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more fun than the time\NI was fumigated for termites.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.22,0:05:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now where did I put those dogs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen some of these
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:06:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, you're still in the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.78,0:06:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I found a new toy to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.22,0:06:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will develop wood rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.10,0:06:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta jump off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this part's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:20.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, someone's trying to get\Nus somewhere and in a big hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.43,0:06:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why do I get the feeling\Nthat someone's not too friendly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.07,0:06:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've\Nbeen carsick without a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.48,0:06:28.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.14,0:06:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This was always good for\Na few laughs. Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's very entertaining, Lord Puppetmon,\Nbut there's no sign of the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.94,0:06:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were here a second ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.26,0:06:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.44,0:06:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.30,0:06:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need a new cable company.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.34,0:07:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a hunch that one of the\NDark Masters is behind all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.70,0:07:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.84,0:07:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we either keep\Ngoing or we build a nest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.22,0:07:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I say we have to fight whoever it\Nis sooner or later, so let's get to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.44,0:07:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again with the fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.27,0:07:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just go to\Na neutral corner already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.53,0:07:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please stop arguing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You keep out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.39,0:07:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's try it your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.70,0:07:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll stay up here and wait\Nfor the enemy to get us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.06,0:07:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:25.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd Tai go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.08,0:07:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.99,0:07:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, did he fall? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.40,0:07:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He vanished into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.82,0:07:32.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, now Mimi's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.68,0:07:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mimi, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.54,0:07:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe their screensavers are on sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.30,0:07:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.62,0:07:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's disappeared but us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.58,0:07:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.30,0:07:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.21,0:07:47.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd we get over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.16,0:07:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been transported.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.28,0:07:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.52,0:07:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hate blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.50,0:07:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now we're separated\Nfrom everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:07:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be all right without\Nthe others, especially Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.60,0:08:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? TK? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:05.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stick close to me, and I'll\Nprotect you no matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.46,0:08:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.58,0:08:10.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason we got this far\Nis because we worked as a team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.30,0:08:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each one of us has played a part along the\Nway in keeping us together, including Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:15.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.74,0:08:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't need you to protect\Nme all the time, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.82,0:08:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you haven't noticed,\NI've grown up a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought alongside you guys since\Nthe beginning and I've always held
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.12,0:08:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my own TK that's not what I meant\Nwhat I what I wanted to say was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.94,0:08:35.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pushing everyone away
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.30,0:08:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three. You're\Nstill in the tree, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.82,0:08:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know Kiwimon this isn't\Nas much fun as I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.16,0:08:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be I should just destroy them all
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:51.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you won't have\Nanyone left to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.64,0:08:52.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:08:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.78,0:09:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joe, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:08.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:10.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.24,0:09:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does it hurt? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.60,0:09:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just doing this because it's fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.50,0:09:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a new game I want to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.40,0:09:20.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.94,0:09:26.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.82,0:09:29.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.50,0:09:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is like playing chess\Nwith the Digi-Destin!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.20,0:09:38.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe for you, where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.26,0:09:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've reached the turning\Npoint! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:52.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Coochie-coochie-coo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:10:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what's so funny,\Nbut this is no laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.42,0:10:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, you're back. TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.08,0:10:06.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I'm getting\Ntired of doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be some cat stuck in a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.50,0:10:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go look for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:10.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.41,0:10:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll start by looking for TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.12,0:10:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:14.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could it get any worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.54,0:10:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you how.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The branches are starting to crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should learn to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.62,0:10:23.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I found a new toy to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.86,0:10:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks very easy to scare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to get him for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.88,0:10:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'll get this one myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.48,0:10:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.46,0:11:00.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess so, but I felt like something was\Ntickling me and I couldn't stop laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.78,0:11:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if there's\Nsomething wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:05.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.10,0:11:07.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop being so worried about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.40,0:11:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you before that I know\Nhow to take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.90,0:11:11.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, T .K., what do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.86,0:11:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the voice is getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.04,0:11:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to play. It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.62,0:11:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your hands off my brother,\NPuppetmon, or I'll chop you into firewood!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.28,0:11:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, come on, be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.40,0:11:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I wanted to do was play\Na little game of war with TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.06,0:11:41.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, play?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.30,0:11:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean like pretend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.84,0:11:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.34,0:11:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you haven't noticed,\NI've grown up a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.14,0:11:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've always held my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:59.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least in the beginning it\Nwill be make-believe anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.50,0:12:00.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then it's bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.10,0:12:03.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it will be time to\Ndestroy you for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.06,0:12:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I got rid of you now, I'd have no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.52,0:12:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, he's just trying to scare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.56,0:12:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to him or your nose will grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.80,0:12:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move now. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.96,0:12:18.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.76,0:12:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, shall we get going? Forget\Nit. I don't want to. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if you don't come\Nwith me, it's no fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.48,0:12:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe instead I'll destroy your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.82,0:12:31.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'll come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.18,0:12:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T .K., it's a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:35.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Run away now or you still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.06,0:12:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.97,0:12:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, is it a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.52,0:12:42.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll have lots of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:56.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you hide, and I'll seek and destroy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.00,0:13:04.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who could it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.26,0:13:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds to me like Lord Puppetmon\Nhas found a new play toy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.04,0:13:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi there! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, I'm hiding back\Nhere, so don't say anything, Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.80,0:13:17.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.24,0:13:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, you didn't happen to see\Nyour little kid run back here, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.92,0:13:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we didn't see\Nanything like that, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we saw was a kid wearing\Na backpack and a green hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's hiding over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.42,0:13:28.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.04,0:13:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Losers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.02,0:13:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come out, come out, wherever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially if you're behind the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will develop wood run.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I found a new toy to play with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.70,0:13:47.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.61,0:13:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep running.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.53,0:13:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You make the game interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.43,0:13:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A house in the middle of the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.70,0:13:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if anyone inside has seen TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.74,0:14:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cuddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.68,0:14:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.12,0:14:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.03,0:14:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK was taken prisoner by\NPuppet Mod! Puppet Mod? Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd that creepy\Nlittle toothpick take TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.42,0:14:30.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a hold of yourself, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.16,0:14:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It shouldn't be that\Ndifficult to find them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.24,0:14:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that first road we were\Non leads directly to Puppet Mod.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.80,0:14:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll all be trapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's worth it to save T.K.\NI agree. Let's go get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.40,0:14:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one may interfere with\NMaster Puppetmon's playtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:49.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all staying right\Nhere. Oh, no! It's Kiwimon!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.49,0:14:56.45,Sign,ANALYZER,0,0,110,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\b1}Kiwimon{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.49,0:14:56.45,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,135,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.49,0:14:56.45,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,175,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.49,0:14:56.45,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,220,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Ancient Bird Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.49,0:14:56.45,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,310,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.49,0:14:56.45,Sign,ANALYZER,380,0,348,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Little Pecker
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.42,0:14:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An ancient Digimon that\Nwas said to be extinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.06,0:14:56.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although he's a bird-type Digimon, his\Nwings have degenerated so he can't fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.70,0:14:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pummel pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.12,0:15:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Koromon, evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.32,0:15:15.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Digimon, have some Pepper Bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spiral Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:24.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Electroshocker!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.22,0:15:27.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New Twister!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.16,0:15:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.68,0:15:36.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what these dolls are for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.24,0:15:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one looks like Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.28,0:15:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:42.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does this stuff always happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anyone push you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.66,0:15:45.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe's on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what else is on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.96,0:15:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's what I call remote control.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.18,0:16:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.18,0:16:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you! The game's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.40,0:16:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna destroy you in a minute,\Nbut first I have to smash my legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.82,0:16:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess that's what I get for\Nhaving a leg made of poison oak!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.06,0:16:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not having any fun at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:39.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's true, how come\Nyou don't have any real friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:40.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.27,0:16:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm the life of the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put the fun in fungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.38,0:16:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can outsmart him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.04,0:16:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just play the same\Ngame over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.76,0:16:53.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not boring. How boring!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.04,0:16:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not having any fun at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.70,0:16:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.92,0:17:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if that's true, how come\Nyou don't have any real friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.10,0:17:03.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got friends. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.28,0:17:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how come I haven't met\Nthese so-called friends of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.74,0:17:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.74,0:17:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get them and introduce you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.50,0:17:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.12,0:17:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:21.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you keeping TK?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.70,0:17:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.90,0:17:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel, Matt, but\Nfirst we have to defeat Kiwimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.22,0:17:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you understand how I feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.48,0:17:46.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand that if we don't beat him\Nfirst, we won't be able to fight TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.50,0:17:47.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.41,0:17:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First we find TK, then\Nwe'll fight your Warp!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon, Warp Digivolve to! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.34,0:18:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't glow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.88,0:18:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:04.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come I can't digiball?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pummel-push!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.94,0:18:10.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There! Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I'd like to make\Nfriends and I've made one!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.58,0:18:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've brought my friend! Look! Huh? T.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.76,0:18:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lord Puppetmon's\Nnew toy Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.72,0:18:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to play chess. Maybe he\Ndoesn't know how to play. Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:56.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piyomon, evolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.40,0:19:03.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bergamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.96,0:19:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.88,0:19:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meteor Wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:17.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Geekybob! Hey, Geekybob!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.56,0:19:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdramon, thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.70,0:19:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome, Be-o-mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.88,0:19:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be-o-mon, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.60,0:19:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look what your Digimon did!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Without Kiwimon, we'll never find TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.86,0:19:34.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down, Matt! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.00,0:19:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's T.K.!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.24,0:19:37.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi, I'm back! TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.60,0:19:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I could do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.14,0:19:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take care of myself just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.06,0:19:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.98,0:19:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.00,0:19:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great job, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.54,0:19:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.24,0:19:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, for a little kid, that\Nwas a pretty big escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.42,0:19:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.33,0:20:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.25,0:20:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.16,0:20:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I also smashed the remote control that\Nwas making the ground move underneath us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's terrific, T.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.88,0:20:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's gonna be all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Papa Mommy's using these\Ndolls to control us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why all those weird\Nthings were happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.51,0:20:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't look anything like this Wow Mimi\Nyour doll is really pretty what no way I
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.46,0:20:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would never wear rags like this oh I could\Ntake her to the wall for some new clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anybody see where Matt went\Nhe's right over there huh huh
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.18,0:20:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he and Gabumon were there\Na second ago They banished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he didn't want to play with me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.18,0:20:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, you'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to keep going on the sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.24,0:21:13.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be able to lose our pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.18,0:21:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to be afraid of our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.38,0:21:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to give you a smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.88,0:21:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of the\Nheart, a weak person.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.90,0:21:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still there. I'm still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.48,0:21:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.54,0:21:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.44,0:21:54.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.24,0:21:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still looking forward to the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to the future.
